### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Admin Register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Registration-Key: {{$dotenv ADMIN_REGISTRATION_KEY}}

{
  "name": "NSolutions Admin",
  "email": "admin@nsolutions.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123"
}

### 2. Admin Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@nsolutions.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123"
}

### 3. Dashboard Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4.  Recent Enquiries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/recent-enquiries?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Recent Leads
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard/recent-leads?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Add Lead
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahul Kumar",
  "company": "ABC Industries",
  "type": "industrial",
  "location": "Visakhapatnam",
  "status": "new"
}

### 7. Get All Leads
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Get One Lead
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/6aa17723268f6f5c8193e974
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. Update Lead
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/6aa17723268f6f5c8193e974
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "qualified"
}

### 10. Delete Lead
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/leads/6aa17768268f6f5c8193e983
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. Add Project (multipart/form-data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ProjectBoundary

--ProjectBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Visakhapatnam Solar Installation
--ProjectBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

industrial
--ProjectBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="location"

Visakhapatnam
--ProjectBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Industrial rooftop solar installation project.
--ProjectBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="services"

["Solar Installation","System Design","Maintenance"]
--ProjectBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="status"

in_progress
--ProjectBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="project-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< {{projectImage}}
--ProjectBoundary--

### 12. Get All Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 13. Get One Project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/6aa17768268f6f5c8193e983
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 14. Get Public Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/projects

### 15. Get Public Project
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/projects/6aa17768268f6f5c8193e983

### 16. Invalid Public Project ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/projects/not-a-valid-id

### 17. Update Project Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/6aa17768268f6f5c8193e983/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### 18. Delete Project
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/projects/6a9db3e00e1d1f60d51b2d32
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


### 19. Add Product (multipart/form-data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ProductBoundary

--ProductBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Monocrystalline Solar Panel
--ProductBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

Solar Panels
--ProductBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="brand"

NSolutions
--ProductBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

High-efficiency rooftop solar panel designed for residential and commercial applications.
--ProductBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="applications"

["Residential rooftops","Commercial rooftops","Ground-mounted systems"]
--ProductBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="product-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< {{projectImage}}
--ProductBoundary--

### 20. Get All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 21. Get One Product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/6aa0297bf2235c24c27b39c9
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 22. Delete Product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/6aa0297bf2235c24c27b39c9
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 23. Get Public Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/products

### 24. Public Submit Enquiry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Mohan Das",
  "companyName": "ABC Industries",
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210",
  "emailAddress": "mohan@example.com",
  "projectLocation": "Visakhapatnam",
  "projectType": "Commercial Solar",
  "monthlyElectricityBill": 45000,
  "message": "Interested in installing a rooftop solar system."
}

### 25. Public Submit Enquiry with invalid email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enquiries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Mohan Das",
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210",
  "emailAddress": "not-an-email",
  "projectType": "Commercial Solar"
}

