GET {{baseUrl}}/api/enquiries
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 27. Get One Enquiry (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/enquiries/6aa1790a268f6f5c8193e9aa
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

