PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/enquiries/6aa1790a268f6f5c8193e9aa/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Resolved"
}

### 29. Delete Enquiry (Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/enquiries/6aa1790a268f6f5c8193e9aa
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

